---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../lib/config';
---

<ContentLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="TempoEmails Disclaimer: general information, fair use policies, and privacy guidelines regarding disposable and temporary email addresses."
  keywords="disclaimer, disposable email terms, temporary email usage disclaimer, anonymous temp mail notice"
>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    <strong>Last Updated:</strong> August 20, 2026
  </p>

  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    The information and temporary email routing services provided by <strong>TempoEmails</strong> (accessible at <strong>{SITE_CONFIG.domain}</strong>) are offered on an "as-is" and "as-available" basis for general convenience, personal privacy protection, and software testing purposes only.
  </p>

  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    By accessing or using TempoEmails, you acknowledge and agree to the disclaimers, limitations, and operational realities outlined in this document.
  </p>

  <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-[#ea2804] pl-4 italic text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-400 mb-4">
    <strong>Crucial Safety Warning:</strong> TempoEmails provides temporary, public, unauthenticated inboxes. <strong>NEVER</strong> use a disposable email address for banking, sensitive financial transactions, primary account recovery, medical records, or confidential correspondence.
  </blockquote>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">1. Nature of the Disposable Email Service</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    TempoEmails is an ephemeral, receive-only email utility. The service is fundamentally designed to provide short-lived, transient mailboxes that automatically expire and purge incoming messages. You understand and accept that:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 mb-4">
    <li><strong>Inboxes are Public & Unauthenticated:</strong> Mailboxes on TempoEmails are generated without individual password protection. Anyone with knowledge of the exact address identifier could theoretically access incoming messages while that address is active.</li>
    <li><strong>No Account Recovery:</strong> If you lose access to a temporary inbox or if it expires, there is no technical mechanism, password reset, or customer support procedure capable of recovering your previous messages.</li>
    <li><strong>Receive-Only Operation:</strong> TempoEmails does not allow outbound emailing or replying. You cannot send messages from generated addresses.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">2. No Guarantee of Message Delivery or Permanence</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    While TempoEmails utilizes resilient routing infrastructure, <strong>we do not and cannot guarantee that any specific email will be received, parsed, or displayed.</strong> Email delivery over the internet is dependent on numerous variables outside our control:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 mb-4">
    <li><strong>Third-Party Sender Restrictions:</strong> Some external websites and online platforms actively detect and block disposable email domains, refusing to send verification emails to temporary addresses.</li>
    <li><strong>Upstream Network & Spam Filters:</strong> Senders' mail servers may throttle, delay, reject, or drop messages prior to reaching our routing gateways.</li>
    <li><strong>Domain Lifecycle Changes:</strong> Domain names associated with TempoEmails may be rotated, replaced, or decommissioned at any time without advance warning.</li>
    <li><strong>Automatic Message Purging:</strong> All received emails are automatically deleted after their short lifespan expires. We make no warranty that messages will persist for any guaranteed minimum timeframe.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">3. Not for Sensitive or Critical Communications</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    TempoEmails is strictly intended for low-risk, transient use cases (such as receiving one-time confirmation links, testing application signups, or browsing content without spam exposure). <strong>You expressly agree NOT to use TempoEmails for:</strong>
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 mb-4">
    <li>Banking, credit union, or financial service accounts.</li>
    <li>Cryptocurrency exchange registrations, wallet recoveries, or two-factor seed verifications.</li>
    <li>Government portals, tax documentation, legal filings, or official notices.</li>
    <li>Primary email addresses for primary social media, work, or long-term digital subscriptions.</li>
    <li>Receiving personally identifiable information (PII), medical records, or trade secrets.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    TempoEmails disclaims all liability for any locked accounts, lost funds, compromised credentials, or missed communications resulting from the misuse of temporary addresses for critical services.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">4. Third-Party Links & Received Email Content</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    Emails displayed in TempoEmails are sent by external third parties. We do not preview, censor, endorse, or verify the safety of content contained within incoming emails:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 mb-4">
    <li><strong>Malicious Links & Attachments:</strong> Incoming messages may contain phishing links, malicious attachments, or misleading promotional claims. Clicking on links or opening attachments within received emails is done entirely at your own risk.</li>
    <li><strong>External Websites:</strong> Links found within emails or on our site may lead to external third-party websites not operated by TempoEmails. We assume no responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party websites.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">5. Third-Party Advertising & Endorsements</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    TempoEmails displays advertisements provided by third-party advertising networks, such as Google AdSense. The display of any advertisement on TempoEmails does not constitute an endorsement, recommendation, guarantee, or warranty by TempoEmails of any advertised product, service, company, or claim.
  </p>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    We are not responsible for any transactions, agreements, or disputes between you and any third-party advertiser.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">6. External APIs and Infrastructure Reliance</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    Our service integrates with upstream mail transfer agents (MTAs), DNS providers, and third-party APIs. While we implement high redundancy, temporary service interruptions, network congestion, or upstream provider outages may occasionally occur. TempoEmails shall not be held liable for any loss or inconvenience resulting from infrastructure downtime or connectivity errors.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">7. Modifications to This Disclaimer</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    We reserve the right to update or amend this Disclaimer at any time without prior notice. Any modifications take effect immediately upon posting to this page. Your continued use of the Service following revisions signifies your acceptance of the updated terms.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">8. Contact Information</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    If you have any questions regarding this Disclaimer or need further clarification, please contact our team:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 mb-4">
    <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${SITE_CONFIG.emails.contact}`} class="text-[#ea2804] hover:underline">{SITE_CONFIG.emails.contact}</a></li>
    <li><strong>Contact Page:</strong> <a href="/contact" class="text-[#ea2804] hover:underline">TempoEmails Support Desk</a></li>
    <li><strong>Terms of Service:</strong> <a href="/terms-of-service" class="text-[#ea2804] hover:underline">View Terms of Service</a></li>
  </ul>
</ContentLayout>
